  - id: great_fish
    displayName: The Great Fish
    flavorText: The LORD prepares a great fish to swallow Jonah, who remains in its
      belly three days and three nights.
    tierType: 1
    purpose: 'God''s appointed instrument of both judgment and rescue: it swallows
      Jonah to save him from drowning after he is cast into the sea, then delivers
      him safely back to dry land, teaching that the LORD''s sovereignty and mercy
      extend even over the sea and its creatures.'
