  - id: jonahs_prayer
    displayName: Jonah's Prayer
    flavorText: Jonah cries out to the LORD from within the fish's belly, vowing
      thanksgiving and declaring that salvation is of the LORD.
    tierType: 1
    purpose: "A psalm of thanksgiving offered in distress, recounting Jonah's descent
      into the deep and affirming that 'salvation is of the LORD' (Jonah 2:9) \u2014
      modeling repentant prayer offered from the depths of consequence, rather than
      a petition to be spared them."
    deliveredByManagerId: jonah
